Date:   Mon Jun 15 17:43:07 2026 +0000

    lucifer PR #43477: DeepSeek V4 / GLM-5.1 SM120 runtime support
    
    Python/runtime portion of the lucifer rebase of vLLM #43477: model code,
    sparse-MLA attention backends (incl. flashinfer SM120 sparse path), DeepGEMM
    and FlashInfer wrappers, warmup, backend selection, tests, and docs.
    
    Contains no build-config changes, so it can be applied after the vLLM build
    (like the other runtime patches).

